#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>

/ {
    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        default_layer {
            bindings = 
                &kp N1    &kp N2    &kp N3    &kp N4    &kp N5
                &kp N6    &kp N7    &kp N8    &kp N9    &kp N5
            >;
            
            sensor-bindings = <&inc_dec_kp C_VOL_UP C_VOL_DN>;
        };
    };
};
```

**Key change:** Added `&none` as the last position in row 1 (position [1,4]) since you don't have a physical key there.

## Your Matrix Layout
```
[0,0] [0,1] [0,2] [0,3] [0,4]  <- Row 0: keys 1,2,3,4,RE_BTN
[1,0] [1,1] [1,2] [1,3] [1,4]  <- Row 1: keys 6,7,8,9,NONE
